  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gole-Kaab: Supporting civil society initiatives to increase citizens&#xbf; awareness and participation in Parliamentary proceedings in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this programme/project is to support civil society initiatives for increasing citizens&#xbf; awareness and participation in parliamentary (federal / state) and district council proceedings in Somalia as well as for enhancing civic oversight to the Federal Parliament and executive in Somalia.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
